      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "19",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "EmuLawi undi nende emusuriawe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne mundaalo etsio olwa omuruchi yali narashiabamwo muIsiraeli ta, omuLawi undi owali namenyilekhwo ehale, mushialo shiebikulu shiaEfuraimu, yaleera omusuria owomuBetelehemu-yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye omusuria tsana yamufukula nakhola akobutamba, namulekha nakalukha ewabwe eBetelehemu-yuda, nabayo eshise shiemiesi chine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana omusaatsawe yarula namulondakhwo, okhusungana ninaye kahala, nokhumukalusia, nali nomusumbawe netsisishili tsibili. Kho yoola ewabo omukhasi tsana; ne olwa samwana omukhasi tsana yamulola, yamwakaanila nokhwikhoya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne nyakhufialanyene, samwana omukhasi, yamushisiayo; naye namenya nnaye tsindaalo tsitaru; nibaliilayo, nibanywa, nibakona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana khunyanga yakhane nibahuuna mumabwibwi, naye niyeekasia mbu yeenyoshe; samwana omukhasi nasunjila nyakhufialanyene mbu Liakhwo ebiliibwa ebitiiti, onyoole amaani, mana olunyumakhwo olatsia butsia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho nibeekhala, nibalia bombi, nende okhunywa; samwana omukhasi nasunjila omundu oyo mbu Chama okone yino, omwoyokwo kutsatsahale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omundu oyo nabuukha mbu yeenyoshe; ne nyakhufialanyene namunichilisia, nakonayo khandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana khunyanga yakharaano yahuuna mumabwibwi mbu yeenyoshe; samwana omukhasi namusunjila mbu Chama olinde okhuula mushitsiambo; mana nibalia bombi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nolwa omundu oyo yabuukha mbu yeenyoshe, halala nomusuriawe nomusumbawe, nyakhufialanyene, samwana omukhasi, namusunjila mbu Lola, bulaano eshialo shiilukhana; okone yino; lola, eshiteere shili okhuhwa; wiyalisieho, mbu omwoyokwo kutsatsahale; mana mukamba ohuune khunjila mbu okalushe eweenyu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa omundu oyo yakhzya okhukonayo eshilo eshio; habula yarula niyeenyokha, niyoola ahahengana nende Yebusi, nilio Yerusalemu; ne yali nali nende tsisishili etsialilwekhwo ebimanulwa biatsio; nomusuriawe yesi yali ninaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nolwa bali nibali ahambi nende Yebusi, eshialo shiali nishiilukhana; omusumba oyo nasunjila omwamiwe ari Chama witse khukotole mwitaala lino liabaYebusi, khukonemwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwamiwe namukaania mbu Shikhulakotola mwitaala liomusuku yesi ourali owomubaana baIsiraeli ta; khubire khutsie eGibea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naboolela omusumbawe ari Chenda khusite ahambi khwitaala elala mukano, khukone eGibea kata eRama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iiho nibabira nibatsiililila, eliuba nilibayeelela nibali ahambi nende Gibea, elili liaBenyamini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibakotolelayo, okhutsia okhukona muGibea; niyeenjila, niyeekhala hasi haluyia olwomwitaala; okhuba yabulaho owabeenjisia munzu okhukona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana omukofu undi yarula khumilimochie mumukunda, khubwile; ne omundu tsana yali oweshialo shiebikulu shiaEfuraimu, nali butswa omumenyibwa muGibea; nebutswa abandu bebweneyo bali abaBenyamini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yachinguula tsimoni, nalola omuchendi oyo nali haluyia lwomuitaala; omukofu namureeba ari Otsia heena? Khandi orula heena? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye namukalusia mbu Khubiranga butswa nikhurula eBetelehemu-yuda, nikhutsia ehale mushialo shiebikulu shiaEfuraimu; ebweneyo neweefwe; ne ninzia eBetelehemu-yuda; ne bulaano enzia eweefwe; kata abulaho omundu ounzinjisia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khulikhwo nende olububa nende ebiokhulia bietsisishili tsieefwe; khandi kuliho emukaate neidivai khulwanje nende omukhasi uno omukholiwo, nende omusooliili owa ifwe abasumbabo khuli ninaye; shikhutamba eshindu ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukofu oyo nababoolela mbu Obe nomulembe; habula mbu ebia wenya biosi bibe khwisie; nebutswa orakona haluyia ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho namwinjisia munzuye, naheelesia tsisishili ebiokhulia; nibeeyosia ebilenje, nibalia nokhunywa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa bali nibeetsatsahasinjia emioyo, lola, abandu belitaala bandi, abamayaanu abeshifwabwi, bafumbila inzu tsimbeka tsiosi, nibatuya emuliango; nibasunjila omwami mwenenzu, omukofu tsana, bari Rusia omundu oyo owitsile munzuyo, khumumanye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye omundu tsana, omwenenzu, yarula nabatsiila, nabasunjila mbu 'A, tawe, baana beefu; emusaaya mbu murakholakhwo obubii murio ta; olwa omundu uno yeenjiile munzu yanje, murakhola akeshifwabwi kano tau e. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lole, omukhaana wanje ngwowuno, nomushisila; nomusuriawe ngwoyo; embarusie abo bulaano, mubafwole nimubakholela aka muchama; nebutswa omundu uno, muramukholela akeshifwabwi akafwana kario ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa abandu tsana bakhaya okhumuhulila; kho omundu tsana yatiila omusuriawe, namubarusilia; nabo nibaba ninaye, nibamukholela obubii eshilo tulu, okhuula olwa bwashia mutsuli; mana obukwe nibusheba, bamulekhuula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana mumashelebende omukhasi tsana niyeetsa, nakwa hamuliango weinzu yomundu oyo, ewa omwamiwe yali, okhuula musenya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana mutsuli omwamiwe nabuukha, niyeekula emiliango chieinzu, narula mbu atsie; nomukhasi oyo omusuriawe ngwoyo, nakwile hamuliango weinzu, amakhonoke nikali khumushi-ngachi kwomuliango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namusunjila mbu Buukha, khutsie; ne likalusio ta. Kho namuchinga namura khusishili; omundu oyo narula niyeenyokha, natsia ewuwe. ",
